news.com/business/us-approves-2-trillion-stimulus-1.1585195858172", "source": "gulfnews.com", "date": "2020-03-26T04:30:00", "title": "US approves $2 trillion stimulus"}, {"url": "https://ktar.com/story/3045185/senate-passes-covid-19-rescue-package-on-unanimous-vote/", "source": "ktar.com", "date": "2020-03-26T04:30:00", "title": "Senate passes COVID-19 rescue package on unanimous vote"}, {"url": "https://santamariatimes.com/news/national/senate-passes-coronavirus-rescue-package-on-unanimous-vote/article_041a8801-b664-58ba-9953-ca0f6443523d.html", "source": "santamariatimes.com", "date": "2020-03-26T04:30:00", "title": "Senate passes coronavirus rescue package on unanimous vote"}, {"url": "https://www.13newsnow.com/article/news/health/coronavirus/senate-passes-2-trillion-coronavirus-rescue-plan-house-still-to-vote/291-10de407c-edf9-4ac4-bf86-f5242fa398a3", "source": "13newsnow.com", "date": "2020-03-26T04:30:00", "title": "Senate passes $2 trillion coronavirus rescue plan; House still to vote"}, {"url": "https://www.kusi.com/senate-unanimously-passes-2-trillion-coronavirus-relief-package/", "source": "kusi.com", "date": "2020-03-26T04:30:00", "title": "Senate unanimously passes $2 trillion coronavirus relief package -"}, {"url": "https://www.kvue.com/article/news/health/coronavirus/coronavirus-rescue-bill-passes-senate/269-10de407c-edf9-4ac4-bf86-f5242fa398a3", "source": "kvue.com", "date": "2020-03-26T04:30:00", "title": "Senate passes $2 trillion coronavirus rescue plan; House still to vote"}, {"url": "https://www.mlive.com/coronavirus/2020/03/senate-passes-coronavirus-rescue-package-on-unanimous-vote.html", "source": "mlive.com", "date": "2020-03-26T04:30:00", "title": "Senate passes coronavirus rescue package on unanimous vote"}, {"url": "https://www.newswest9.com/article/news/health/coronavirus/coronavirus-rescue-bill-passes-senate/513-10de407c-edf9-4ac4-bf86-f5242fa398a3", "source": "newswest9.com", "date": "2020-03-26T04:30:00", "title": "Senate passes $2 tri