rus aid plan"}, {"url": "https://madison.com/news/nation/government-and-politics/senate-unanimously-passes-massive-coronavirus-aid-plan/article_3d164f4d-1d6d-5848-88f3-4fb255d05b24.html", "source": "madison.com", "date": "2020-03-26T11:00:00", "title": "Senate unanimously passes massive coronavirus aid plan"}, {"url": "https://mtstandard.com/news/national/govt-and-politics/senate-unanimously-passes-massive-coronavirus-aid-plan/article_170b59c3-8859-5cb9-9736-43e447fa9aff.html", "source": "mtstandard.com", "date": "2020-03-26T11:00:00", "title": "Senate unanimously passes massive coronavirus aid plan"}, {"url": "https://www.ctvnews.ca/health/coronavirus/u-s-senate-unanimously-passes-massive-coronavirus-aid-plan-1.4868939", "source": "ctvnews.ca", "date": "2020-03-26T11:00:00", "title": "U.S. Senate unanimously passes massive coronavirus aid plan"}, {"url": "https://www.khq.com/national/senate-unanimously-passes-massive-coronavirus-aid-plan/article_92cc02b4-a3f8-5da5-b9b4-3fcb21c25d97.html", "source": "khq.com", "date": "2020-03-26T11:00:00", "title": "Senate unanimously passes massive coronavirus aid plan"}, {"url": "https://www.mymotherlode.com/news/national/us-government/1032549/senate-passes-2-2-trillion-economic-rescue-package-in-response-to-coronavirus-pandemic-house-vote-friday.html", "source": "mymotherlode.com", "date": "2020-03-26T11:00:00", "title": "Senate passes $2.2 trillion economic rescue package in response to coronavirus pandemic; House vote Friday"}, {"url": "https://www.wiscnews.com/news/national/govt-and-politics/senate-unanimously-passes-massive-coronavirus-aid-plan/article_137bb142-7f9a-5f9c-9609-2ac4ad9abc23.html", "source": "wiscnews.com", "date": "2020-03-26T11:00:00", "title": "Senate unanimously passes massive coronavirus aid plan"}, {"url": "http://m.newson6.com/story/41940575/senate-passes-coronavirus-rescue-package-on-unanimous-vote", "source": "newson6.com", "date": "2020-03-26T11:15:00", "title": "Senate Passes Coronavirus Rescue Package On Unanimous Vote"}, {"url": "https://jg-tc.com/news/national/govt-and-politics/senate-unanimously-passes-massive-coronavirus-aid-plan/article_894a5fc4-270d-5680-b5a3-bde767dba27d.html", "source": "jg-tc.com", "date": "2020-03-26T11:15:00", "title": "Senate unanimously passes massive coronavirus aid plan"}, {"url": "https://rapidcityjournal.com/news/national/govt-and-politics/senate-unanimously-passes-massive-coronavirus-aid-plan/article_58ff7384-2b9d-58e1-bf1d-bb3bbf7f81be.html", "source": "rapidcityjournal.com", "date": "2020-03-26T11:15:00", "title": "Senate unanimously passes massive coronavirus aid plan"}, {"url": "https://siouxcityjournal.com/news/national/govt-and-politics/senate-unanimously-passes-massive-coronavirus-aid-plan/article_163e39c5-345c-5615-bdbe-ce7622620674.html", "source": "siouxcityjournal.com", "date": "2020-03-26T11:15:00", "title": "Senate unanimously passes massive coronavirus aid plan"}, {"url": "https://www.bdtonline.com/news/senate-unanimously-passes-massive-coronavirus-aid-plan/article_08fad999-24b1-5ddd-9ebc-490f6e12a719.html", "source": "bdtonline.com", "date": "2020-03-26T11:15:00", "title": "Senate unanimously passes massive coronavirus aid plan"}, {"url": "https://www.herald-dispatch.com/ap/ap_nation/senate-unanimously-passes-massive-coronavirus-aid-plan/article_6717092b-f2d5-5f18-a6c5-b4ec443e6304.html", "source": "herald-dispatch.com", "date": "2020-03-26T11:15:00", "title": "Senate unanimously passes massive coronavirus aid plan"}, {"url": "https://www.masslive.com/politics/2020/03/coronavirus-stimulus-package-senate-unanimously-passes-22-trillion-economic-rescue-plan.html", "source": "masslive.com", "date": "2020-03-26T11:15:00", "title": "Coronavirus stimulus package: Senate unanimously passes $2.2 trillion economic rescue plan"}, {"url": "https://www.mdjonline.com/ap/business/senate-unanimously-passes-massive-coronavirus-aid-plan/article_875203e0-d9bb-5928-9657-31f3eede2316.html", "source": "mdjonline.com", "date": "2020-